    "created_at": "2025-02-10T14:05:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-10T14:05:01Z",
    "body": "I'm suffering with this issues in some other places, too. A few different sources to check:\n* ISO (22028-5 and 21496-1)\n* SMPTE (ST 2086 and ST 2094 series)\n* ITU BT.2408, BT.2100, BT.1886\n* sRGB specification (CEI 61966-2-1)\n* ICC specification\n\nFrom what I can tell, it's all over the map. The ISO, ITU, and SMPTE standards seem to be fairly consistent with \"component\" (though not 100%, especially BT 2408). ICC seems to alternate between them a lot, but seems to be the one that has the most support for \"channel\".\n\nI'd vote for \"component\".",
